{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"           ✧✦2016FNSうたの夏まつり✧✦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていただけましたか〜?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プールサイドでは『世界には愛しかない』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森山直太朗さんと一緒に『さくら』、山口百恵さんの『ひと夏の経験』を披露させていただきました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっきどきで足も声もがくがくに震えてしまいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり歌うこと、踊ることってすっごく楽しい*ﾟ✲ฺ٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و ✲ฺﾟ*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*.....*.....*.....*.....*.....*.....*.....*.....*.....*....*.....*.....*.....*.....*.....*....."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして今日は楽屋でみーこが静かだな〜と思ったらお勉強をしていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8TMCE6C6ACZ982MGKQKRF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分かんないよ〜って可愛い顔で私に助けを求めてきたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら難しい問題解けないんだな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーこがお勉強を頑張っている中私は西野カナさんの曲を聴いて1人で盛り上がっていました୧⃛(๑⃙⃘◡̈๑⃙⃘)୨⃛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきだ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8TNC51DAED6YKFCDJMBRP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}